      </div>

      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-zinc-100 tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
        Translating formalist cinema and off-screen dread into gaze-contingent media architectures.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light">
        Bridging years of auteur filmmaking—investigating <em>hors-champ</em>, acousmatic tension, and static negative space—with computer vision and affective computing to build real-time adaptive montage systems.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-mono">
