      <!-- Aesthetic Hypothesis & Engineering Architecture -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 pt-4">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-medium text-zinc-200">Aesthetic Hypothesis & System Logic</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
            Operationalizing the cinematic void (<em>hors-champ</em>): when an off-screen acousmatic cue emerges beyond the frame boundary, the engine measures whether spectator fixation lingers on the primary subject or drifts toward empty negative space. If neglected, an adaptive cut dynamically exposes the off-screen dread agent with synchronized multi-track audio cross-fading.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-medium text-zinc-200">System Architecture Pipeline</h3>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono space-y-2 text-zinc-400 bg-surface/50 p-4 rounded border border-zinc-900">
            <div><span class="text-zinc-500">01. Optical Input:</span> Video Stream &rarr; 468-point Iris/Facial Mesh</div>
            <div><span class="text-zinc-500">02. Pose Correction:</span> 3D solvePnP Stabilization & EAR Blink Filter</div>
            <div><span class="text-zinc-500">03. Calibration:</span> 2nd-degree Polynomial Ridge Regression</div>
            <div><span class="text-zinc-500">04. Perception:</span> Asynchronous GPU Semantic Segmentation</div>
            <div><span class="text-zinc-500">05. Montage:</span> Finite State Machine Stream & Sound Crossfade</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Research Arc -->
    <section id="arc" class="space-y-12">
      <div class="border-b border-zinc-900 pb-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Methodology</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-zinc-100 mt-1">The Research Arc: Practice-Based Trajectory</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">PHASE I &bull; ARTISTIC INQUIRY</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg text-zinc-200">Directorial Form & Negative Space</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
            Formulating formal hypotheses on spatial anxiety, static wide-angle compositions, and acousmatic dread through short-film directing. These cinematic works served as empirical testbeds to investigate how cinematic composition channels attention without explicit visual cues.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">PHASE II &bull; COMPUTATIONAL TURN</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg text-zinc-200">Affective Telemetry & Adaptive Media</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
            Translating authored directorial hypotheses into quantitative systems: applying real-time gaze telemetry to compute spectator dwell-time on frame regions, replacing rigid linear timelines with reactive computational montage engines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Directorial Foundations / 3 Short Film Testbeds -->
    <section id="testbeds" class="space-y-16">
