            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              Constructed with severe negative space and off-screen auditory cues. This work investigates the tension between visible silence and auditory dread, serving as the foundational stimulus to measure saccadic gaze shifts toward uninhabited frame quadrants prior to cutting.
            </p>
