            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200">Static Wide-Angle Composition & Architectural Dread</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              Utilizing deep staging, wide-angle lens geometry, and prolonged static shots inspired by formalist cinema. Employed within the computational pipeline to test whether geometric edge distortion affects peripheral gaze clustering and fixation stability.
            </p>
