            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200">Temporal Stasis & Durational Tension</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              Explores extreme temporal duration to challenge spectator restlessness and gaze fatigue. Deployed directly to calibrate the state machine's dwell-time threshold for automated montage triggers.
            </p>
